# ========================================
# NOTES FOR PROTECTION
# ========================================
# This .gitignore protects:
# 1. 70% I/O reduction database optimization techniques
# 2. Proprietary 20 AI model architecture
# 3. zk-SNARKs implementation for FCA/SEC compliance
# 4. 8-suite finance architecture and business logic
# 5. 1M records/day data pipeline optimizations
# 6. Databricks marketplace integration strategies
# 7. Competitive pricing and revenue models
# 8. Client data and business intelligence
# 9. Security implementations and cryptographic keys
# 10. All proprietary algorithms and trade secrets

# REMEMBER: Even with .gitignore, be careful about:
# - Commit history (use git filter-branch if needed)
# - Public repositories vs private repositories
# - Team member access controls
# - Regular security audits of exposed information